### Webhook: Stripe Payment Success
POST {{BASE_DOMAIN}}/webhook/stripe-payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt_stripe_12345",
  "type": "payment_intent.succeeded",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "pi_12345ABCDE",
      "amount": 450000,
      "currency": "chf",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "metadata": {
        "company_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
        "payment_type": "deposit"
      },
      "created": 1705329000
    }
  }
}

### Webhook: Stripe Payment Failed
POST {{BASE_DOMAIN}}/webhook/stripe-payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt_stripe_67890",
  "type": "payment_intent.payment_failed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "pi_67890FGHIJ",
      "amount": 450000,
      "currency": "chf",
      "status": "requires_payment_method",
      "last_payment_error": {
        "code": "card_declined",
        "message": "Your card was declined"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "company_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
        "payment_type": "deposit"
      },
      "created": 1705329000
    }
  }
}

