### Webhook: NPS Response
POST {{BASE_DOMAIN}}/webhook/nps-response
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "form_response": {
    "form_id": "NpNpNpNp",
    "submitted_at": "2025-01-30T10:00:00Z",
    "hidden": {
      "company_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
    },
    "answers": [
      {
        "type": "number",
        "number": 9,
